OL,3,GNEWSAMan's brother, uncle and cousin
OL,4,Adie in Nepal flash floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Nepalese man living in Aberdeen has
OL,7,Ftold BBC Scotland News he lost three
OL,8,Fclose family members in the deadly
OL,9,Fflash floods that hit his home country
OL,10,Fon Wednesday.
OL,12,FBarun Lamichhane, 26, said his brother,
OL,13,Funcle and cousin all died in the
OL,14,Fdisaster - but that his mother, father
OL,15,Fand grandmother managed to escape.
OL,17,FLamichhane said they managed to get
OL,18,Faway by "crawling like a baby" into the
OL,19,Fhillside.
OL,21,FMore than 350 people have died, with
OL,22,Fmore than 1,000 reported to be missing.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
